# 📊 Dynamic Pricing Analytics & Optimization Engine

An end-to-end Machine Learning and Analytics dashboard designed for Retail and E-Commerce platforms. This application leverages price elasticity modeling, historical transaction data, and promotional uplift parameters to recommend optimal price points that maximize both top-line revenue and net profit without sacrificing customer retention.

---

### 🌟 Key Features

* **💡 Real-Time Recommendation Engine**: Instantly generates revenue-maximizing price points along with expected demand loss limits and net profit margins.
* **📈 Interactive Sensitivity Curves**: Interactive Plotly charts mapping Price vs. Demand response, Revenue curves, and Net Profit optimization boundaries.
* **🎛️ Dynamic Price Simulator**: Real-time slider allowing business users to simulate custom price scenarios and assess immediate financial impacts.
* **⚡ One-Click Catalog Update**: Interactive session workflow enabling users to apply recommended pricing directly to active inventory.
* **🤖 Model Accuracy Metrics**: Displays core ML performance metrics ($R^2$, MAE) alongside contextual business explanations for model explainability.
